  "title": "Dynamite Bourbon Ribs",
  "description": "These country-style pork ribs marinated in bourbon, brown sugar, and garlic are best cooked on the grill, but can also be baked. Serve with a crispy salad and garlic cheese potatoes for a great dinner!",
  "authors": [
